## Why This Is Asked
This question tests the ability to design extensible, testable pipelines with runtime plugins, thoughtful error handling, and clear isolation guarantees.

## Key Concepts
- **Command pattern** for Job abstraction with execute(context) method
- **Registry/Factory** for runtime extension points—new Job types can be registered without modifying the engine
